flowchart LR
  S[1 Subassembly build-up] --> I[2 Integration]
  I --> Q1[Build records review] --> F[3 Functional test]
  F -- pass --> E[4 Environmental test<br/>vibration + thermal vacuum chamber]
  F -- fail --> I
